stateDiagram-v2
    title Content Flag & Moderation State Machine

    [*] --> NoFlags : Story published\n(no flags)

    NoFlags --> Flagged : User flags story\n(cultural inaccuracy,\ninappropriate, etc.)

    Flagged --> UnderReview : Manager/Admin\nviews queue

    UnderReview --> Resolved_Keep : Action = dismiss\n(story kept)
    UnderReview --> Resolved_Remove : Action = remove\n(story archived)

    Resolved_Keep --> NoFlags : Flags cleared\n(story remains)
    Resolved_Remove --> Archived : Story archived

    Archived --> [*]

    note right of NoFlags : All flags resolved.\nStory is clean.
    note right of Flagged : Unresolved flags\nin moderation queue.
    note right of UnderReview : Admin/Manager\nreviewing flags.
    note right of Resolved_Keep : Flags dismissed.\nStory stays published.
    note right of Resolved_Remove : Story archived.\nHidden from public.
